  <jpcrp_cor:PlaceForPublicInspectionCoverPageTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;letter-spacing:0.0pt;line-height:18.0pt;"&gt;三京化成株式会社東京支社&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-10.0pt;letter-spacing:0.0pt;line-height:18.0pt;"&gt;　(東京都中央区新川一丁目23番５号(ONE SHINKAWA))&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-10.0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;三京化成株式会社浜松支店&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-10.0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;　(浜松市中央区佐藤一丁目40番21号)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-10.0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;三京化成株式会社名古屋支店&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-10.0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;　(名古屋市中区丸の内三丁目22番24号(名古屋桜通ビル))&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-10.0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;株式会社東京証券取引所&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-10.0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;　(東京都中央区日本橋兜町２番１号)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;(注)　三京化成株式会社浜松支店は、法定の縦覧場所ではありませんが、投資家の便宜のため縦覧に供しております。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:PlaceForPublicInspectionCoverPageTextBlock>
